{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_02_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9499408360e90444446ed2c2c80f162c2cb655e1f049636a4875838b0489639c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50346246c17f1ca2b6d4eb47c8c66daead823069531e1296210f5009dcacef6a",
      "text": "是的！不仅是电视，\n还能在其他各种媒体上露面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c4aaa2e2ba0228bd8ffd143b9e59f45bea09bc1ebd2e5278386ce1cdb5b3454",
      "text": "这样啊，也是啊。\n毕竟偶像要做的事情很多嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5631d6e37e427320dff8da755f1d4db2ec93b2f6c198640becebc5109f20f1ee",
      "text": "你这家伙，对电视感兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:182c4ae6bfc2a7279bb3cdac091f49a3b7d7b45f7b9a2901f8b8c97617b3518e",
      "text": "没，也不是感兴趣……\n我老爸老妈不是摔角手嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58e615a3eb4281452e9b66ff6262c0eaae1a2868f00fcdc60d1cecc67b27f91e",
      "text": "他们俩在电视里打倒的都是坏蛋角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5aeb9289d9c244c03ca63f6c4843f87ca3ecc979d94a530cd570d11ac61c808",
      "text": "但为什么不去打倒真正的坏蛋呢，\n我从小就一直看不惯这点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de8fd04adf242b9c8140e7268f3176bd68e0f4d6a4e0474382ce7ab16a7ebb9",
      "text": "明明换作老爸他们的话，\n不管是多厉害的坏蛋都能打倒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7b96a49e0f5abb00799915578cfc0f8b27133834f513bfa521696b2060acccf",
      "text": "朱雀……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcb34cd07e18b470a52c8caedaf4c6a2128d21938c7163b0a7c59bb54c590d5",
      "text": "所以就总觉得有点在意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef7de0795969539609e75bf113d3e2ceb6f79e13996cb52eec4097b524bdff43",
      "text": "（嗯？不过这么说来，这不就是我上电视\n打倒真正恶徒的好机会吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f66e0e3fc8d9dc460af8d322752f86a602f8f85312b327c2752120eefcd49b9d",
      "text": "（我正好觉得光凭一双拳头直接去退治恶人，\n根本就治不过来呢……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ced0dd83d721e0536a0193c0d17d0c73a57d0d567dab9be76144407f6ea7e553",
      "text": "（要是上了电视，就能和无数的恶势力战斗了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d648b2424735392e781c8bb17f35f92e62039462ab32561337f633465bf6d128",
      "text": "喂，玄武！我们一起上电视，\n隔着电视狠狠瞪过去吧……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554df9ed789204bc58048f97b49d97ba7b872abdf5abce85061d05dd19806bd5",
      "text": "我们去当能把那帮恶人\n吓得瑟瑟发抖的偶像吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
